<template><div class="app-container"><el-alert title="当前 V1 指标直接从业务账本聚合，适合验收和小规模运行；数据量增大后应切换到日汇总表。" type="warning" :closable="false" style="margin-bottom:16px"/><el-button type="primary" :loading="loading" @click="load">刷新</el-button><el-row :gutter="16" style="margin-top:16px"><el-col v-for="item in cards" :key="item.key" :span="6"><el-card shadow="hover" style="margin-bottom:16px"><div style="color:#909399">{{item.label}}</div><div style="font-size:28px;font-weight:600;margin-top:10px">{{data[item.key]||0}}</div></el-card></el-col></el-row></div></template><script>import{getJkPhaseSixOverview}from'@/api/jkBusiness';export default{data(){return{loading:false,data:{},cards:[{key:'activeIdentityCount',label:'有效业务身份'},{key:'stockAccountCount',label:'库存账户'},{key:'platformOrderCount',label:'平台订货单'},{key:'stockTransferCount',label:'库存调拨单'},{key:'transferReturnCount',label:'调拨退回单'},{key:'pendingCommissionAmount',label:'待结算佣金'},{key:'withdrawPendingAmount',label:'处理中提现'},{key:'deadEventCount',label:'终止业务事件'},{key:'accountMismatchCount',label:'账户对账异常'},{key:'activeHealthAlertCount',label:'健康预警'},{key:'deniedHealthAccessCount',label:'拒绝健康访问'},{key:'openRiskEventCount',label:'待处理风险'}]}},created(){this.load()},methods:{load(){this.loading=true;getJkPhaseSixOverview().then(r=>this.data=r&&r.data?r.data:r||{}).finally(()=>this.loading=false)}}}</script>